        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/t/58956e/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2013-08-06T22:36:37.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Hey all,</p><p>The project is finally here and you get the chance to be about of it. Want to play your favorite character from the core rules? What to beat up a villain in true RPG fashion? Then join me at GenCon for some Sentinels RPG action.</p><p>I am looking at some time after the Volunteer dinner or possibly Saturday Evening. Space is to be determined but all are welcome.</p><p>Hope to see you there and please let me know at the dinner or the booth if you want to play (or here if you feel so inclined).</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
